irƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WRLWUoqtwr0JodPy0588BxYrisO4G-gWOr9Ox_oBFMAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWhttps://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/20/online-exploitation-children-warningƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mx1Z81KVhuJv--hGNlf99OBg8itqJosG2CLwLQL0pVwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9https://newscable-source-broker.invalid/activitypub/actorƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;lGQ1kX8K2iodlRNUnn1pOnlyhIVVdD4JHMaKpeg70DIƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VCv-cXBsyrm0sWdcbXQ8vwtNtqYiHDOIY7GOYoc9UcQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxWhttps://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/20/online-exploitation-children-warningƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;A1NyqpUcUtGL8-TXGGQeMWqKmFD4BBKcm-bnyyMt9tYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarky•<p>Global increase in cases of predators coercing children to harm themselves or produce child sexual abuse material</p><p>Cases of predators coercing children into producing sexual photos and videos of themselves have surged globally in the past year, a cruel phenomenon known as â€œsadistic online exploitationâ€, child safety experts and law enforcement officials warn.</p><p>In cases of sadistic online exploitation, perpetrators target vulnerable teens on social media platforms and online games. These predators then compel their victims into producing child sexual abuse material (CSAM), harming themselves and others, or, in extreme cases, attempting suicide.</p><p><em>In the US, call or text the <a href="https://www.childhelp.org/hotline/">Childhelp</a> abuse hotline on 800-422-4453 or visit <a href="https://www.childhelphotline.org/">their website</a> for more resources and to report child abuse or DM for help. For adult survivors of child abuse, help is available at <a href="https://www.ascasupport.org/">ascasupport.org</a>. In the UK, the <a href="https://www.nspcc.org.uk/">NSPCC</a> offers support to children on 0800 1111, and adults concerned about a child on 0808 800 5000. The National Association for People Abused in Childhood (<a href="https://napac.org.uk/">Napac</a>) offers support for adult survivors on 0808 801 0331. In Australia, children, young adults, parents and teachers can contact the Kids Helpline on 1800 55 1800, or <a href="https://bravehearts.org.au/">Bravehearts</a> on 1800 272 831, and adult survivors can contact <a href="https://www.blueknot.org.au/">Blue Knot Foundation</a> on 1300 657 380. Other sources of help can be found at <a href="https://www.childhelplineinternational.org/child-helplines/child-helpline-network/">Child Helplines International</a></em></p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/20/online-exploitation-children-warning">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vPACWxdRA7JZcddnn6jjzXf3vJnMF87khwqOfpshW0Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;Yn9Aa-hErM5Wa8bbdZh6FW5X-pNM2xPUTOHaqHLmYGsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;poC6Du9i8lmgj_qgDS6liMWICau7Ic4Pj34Yu52iZF4ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;w8KLTD5-K8EnJr-_DGqsoJHaGKaAxRBrvhTM1g5ti6Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;ub0SjsqLRyqW784s-OtfQ9B_jOzeZGSkha0F4hizjFQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasef